                                    <h1>Jewelry Founder-to-Founder Call with Prashant Chaudhari &amp;mdash; ITD GrowthLabs (2026)</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>For jewelry founders + brand directors + CMOs who want a founder-to-founder conversation before committing to an agency engagement, this page explains how to reach me (Prashant Chaudhari, founder + business head of ITD GrowthLabs) directly + what a founder-to-founder call typically covers.</p><p>Founder calls are for serious brand-fit discussions + strategic feedback + honest agency-choice guidance &mdash; not sales pitches. I walk away from engagements that are not a fit + tell founders honestly if a different agency + tier + envelope suits their brand better.</p>
                                    <h2>Who I am + why founder-to-founder matters</h2>
                                    <p>I'm Prashant Chaudhari, founder + business head of ITD GrowthLabs. Background: 10+ years in D2C marketing + technology + product across jewelry, logistics, real estate, fintech, healthcare, and F&amp;B verticals. Prior + concurrent: built Trackmate Lite (logistics SaaS in production) + delivered 5+ SaaS engagements + built ITD's jewelry vertical publishing (50+ jewelry cluster pieces + Fabelia case study + 8+ playbooks + 6 GCC city-specific pages).</p><p><strong>Why founder-to-founder matters for jewelry brands:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Jewelry is a high-consideration + high-trust category. Founders make big + long-cycle decisions.</li><li>Agency + brand fit is critical &mdash; wrong fit costs 6-12 months of stalled growth.</li><li>Direct founder access removes junior-team layers + gets straight to strategic feedback.</li><li>Honest fit assessment saves both sides months of wrong-fit engagement risk.</li></ul>
                                    <h2>What a founder-to-founder call typically covers</h2>
                                    <p>60-90 minute video call (scheduled via Calendly or direct WhatsApp) covering:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Your brand story + founder journey (15 min):</strong> How the brand started, what motivated the founder, current stage + traction.</li><li><strong>Strategic gaps + honest audit (20 min):</strong> Where your current marketing + brand + funnel + team is strong vs weak. Honest read from my perspective as an external category-experienced observer.</li><li><strong>Category + sub-vertical positioning conversation (20 min):</strong> Fine vs fashion vs bridal vs lab-grown vs men's + India vs GCC vs international geography. Where you win + where you're at risk.</li><li><strong>Agency-fit assessment (15 min):</strong> Is ITD the right agency for your brand? What tier fits? Or should you evaluate alternatives (sub-vertical specialist + luxury boutique + freelancer collective)?</li><li><strong>Q&amp;A + immediate feedback + next steps (10 min):</strong> What to do next regardless of ITD engagement.</li></ul><p>Sometimes shorter (30-45 min) if agenda is tighter. Sometimes longer (2 hours) if brand + strategy is complex.</p>
                                    <h2>Who founder-to-founder calls are right for</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Founders seriously considering an agency engagement + wanting founder-level assessment before committing.</li><li>Brands at Rs 25L+ / month revenue evaluating scaling + agency + tier decisions.</li><li>Pre-launch founders with well-funded + serious launch envelope (Rs 25L+) wanting founder-level strategy input.</li><li>Existing brands facing a scaling stall + wanting external founder perspective on options.</li><li>Founders with unusual + strategic questions where junior-team discovery calls don't give enough depth.</li></ul><p><strong>Not right for:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Very early-stage founders still deciding whether to launch. Standard 30-min discovery call is enough.</li><li>Vendors + freelancers looking for partnership + sales opportunities. Please use business partnerships contact.</li><li>Founders looking for free consulting without engagement intent. Founder-founder calls are for serious brand-fit discussions, not open-ended free advisory.</li></ul>
                                    <h2>How to reach me directly for a founder call</h2>
                                    <p>Direct channels:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Calendly (founder-founder track):</strong> Book a 60-min slot via Calendly. Auto-detects your timezone + confirms slot within 1 hour.</li><li><strong>WhatsApp direct:</strong> Message on +91 9XXX XXX XXX with your brand + URL + LinkedIn + brief context on why you want a founder call. I respond within 4-8 business hours.</li><li><strong>LinkedIn DM:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/prashantchaudhari" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin.com/in/prashantchaudhari</a>. Connect with a brief note + I'll respond within 24 hours.</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> prashant@itdgrowthlabs.com. Direct email for founders wanting formal outreach.</li></ul><p>Whichever channel you use, include: brand name + Shopify URL + Instagram handle + brief context (current revenue + sub-vertical + geography + why founder-to-founder call). This context maximises call value + lets me prep properly.</p>
                                    <h2>What happens after the founder call</h2>
                                    <p>Post-call options:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>If ITD is a fit + you want to proceed:</strong> Standard proposal within 3 business days with recommended tier + 90-day plan + budget + team + timeline. Standard 6-month MSA + kick-off.</li><li><strong>If ITD is a fit but you want to compare with alternatives first:</strong> Take our proposal + evaluate against 2-4 alternative agencies + come back within 60-90 days when ready to decide.</li><li><strong>If ITD isn't the right fit + I recommend an alternative:</strong> I'll suggest specific alternative agencies (sub-vertical specialist + luxury boutique + freelancer collective) that better match your brand + tier + geography. No obligation to work with us.</li><li><strong>If timing isn't right yet:</strong> Come back when brand + funding + team + timing align. I'll remember our conversation + we can pick up from there.</li></ul><p>No high-pressure follow-up + no hard-sell. Founder-to-founder calls are for serious strategic conversations + honest assessments.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Who is Prashant Chaudhari and why does founder-to-founder access matter?</h3>
                                        <p>Prashant is founder + business head of ITD GrowthLabs. 10+ years D2C marketing + technology + product across jewelry, logistics, real estate, fintech, healthcare, F&B. Built Trackmate Lite logistics SaaS + delivered 5+ SaaS engagements + built ITD jewelry vertical (50+ pieces + Fabelia + 8+ playbooks + 6 GCC city pages). Founder-founder matters for jewelry because it removes junior-team layers + gets straight to strategic feedback + honest fit assessment.</p>
                                        <h3>What does a founder-to-founder call typically cover?</h3>
                                        <p>60-90 minutes: brand story + founder journey (15 min), strategic gaps + honest audit (20 min), category + sub-vertical positioning conversation (20 min), agency-fit assessment (15 min), Q&A + immediate feedback + next steps (10 min). Shorter (30-45 min) or longer (2 hours) depending on agenda complexity.</p>
                                        <h3>Who is founder-to-founder call right for?</h3>
                                        <p>Founders seriously considering agency engagement + wanting founder-level assessment. Brands at Rs 25L+ / month evaluating scaling + agency + tier decisions. Pre-launch founders with Rs 25L+ envelope wanting founder-level strategy input. Existing brands facing scaling stall + wanting external founder perspective. Founders with unusual + strategic questions.</p>
                                        <h3>Who is founder-to-founder call NOT right for?</h3>
                                        <p>Very early-stage founders still deciding whether to launch (standard 30-min discovery is enough). Vendors + freelancers looking for partnership + sales opportunities (use business partnerships contact). Founders looking for free open-ended consulting without engagement intent.</p>
                                        <h3>How can we reach Prashant directly for a founder call?</h3>
                                        <p>(1) Calendly founder-founder track (60-min slot). (2) WhatsApp direct: +91 9XXX XXX XXX with brand + URL + LinkedIn + context. (3) LinkedIn DM: linkedin.com/in/prashantchaudhari with brief note. (4) Direct email: prashant@itdgrowthlabs.com. Include brand name + Shopify URL + Instagram + brief context (revenue + sub-vertical + geography + why founder call).</p>
                                        <h3>What if Prashant recommends an alternative agency instead of ITD?</h3>
                                        <p>That happens. If ITD isn't the right fit, Prashant suggests specific alternative agencies (sub-vertical specialist + luxury boutique + freelancer collective) matching your brand + tier + geography. No obligation to work with ITD. Honest fit assessment saves both sides months of wrong-fit engagement risk.</p>
                                        <h3>What happens if timing isn't right yet?</h3>
                                        <p>Come back when brand + funding + team + timing align. Prashant remembers the conversation + you can pick up from there. No high-pressure follow-up + no hard-sell. Founder-founder calls are for serious strategic conversations, not sales pipeline.</p>
                                        <h3>How is the founder-to-founder call different from the standard discovery call?</h3>
                                        <p>Standard 30-min discovery: senior strategist + Prashant + operational fit + tier assessment. Founder-founder 60-90 min: deep-dive strategic conversation + honest audit + category positioning + agency-fit assessment across alternatives. Both are free. Founder call is for founders who want deeper strategic engagement before committing.</p>
